<title>USA: Calif. $32 mln bonds repriced, Goldman cuts yields.</title>
<headline>Calif. $32 mln bonds repriced, Goldman cuts yields.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced $31.9 million State Public Works Board of the State of California bonds, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2012 unchanged at 5.65 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
